Jeti — a C-superset systems language with Objective-C-style message dispatch
Copyright 2026 3shine123

This product includes the Jeti compiler (jetic), the Jeti runtime
(libjeti.a), and the Jeti Foundation library (libjetifoundation.a),
developed as part of the Jeti language project.

The async/await semantics are modeled on Swift's concurrency design.
